sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Retailer as Retailer
    actor Reviewer as Administrator / Operator

    participant Mobile as Retailer Mobile App
    participant Portal as Web Portal

    participant API as ComplaintsController

    participant Service as ComplaintService
    participant Completion as OrderCompletionService
    participant Loyalty as LoyaltyAccrualService

    participant Store as ComplaintStore
    participant CompletionStore as OrderCompletionStore

    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 1 - SUBMIT SHIPMENT-LINKED COMPLAINT
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Retailer,DB: PART 1 - SUBMIT SHIPMENT-LINKED COMPLAINT

    Retailer->>+Mobile: Submit complaint for received goods

    Note right of Mobile: Enter OrderCode, SKU, LabelCode and ActualQty
    Note right of Mobile: Attach optional Note, EvidenceUrl and ShipmentId

    Mobile->>+API: Create(request)

    Note right of API: Endpoint requires Retailer role

    API->>+Service: CreateAsync(actorId, data, ct)

    Service->>+Store: CreateAsync(actorId, data, now, ct)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. VALIDATE REQUIRED INPUT
    %% ==========================================

    Note right of Store: Validate OrderCode, SKU and LabelCode
    Note right of Store: ActualQuantity must not be negative

    alt Required input is invalid

        Note right of Store: Return Validation error

    else Required input is valid

        %% ==========================================
        %% 2. VERIFY RETAILER AND ORDER
        %% ==========================================

        Store->>+DB: SELECT active Retailer and owned SalesOrder
        DB-->>Store: Retailer and SalesOrder or null
        deactivate DB

        Store->>+DB: SELECT SalesOrderLine JOIN Product by SKU
        DB-->>Store: Order line and Product or null
        deactivate DB

        alt Retailer, order or SKU is invalid

            Note right of Store: Return Forbidden or Not Found

        else Retailer owns the order and SKU

            %% ==========================================
            %% 3. VERIFY CONFIRMED RECEIPT
            %% ==========================================

            Store->>+DB: SELECT confirmed ReceiptConfirmation by SalesOrderId
            DB-->>Store: ReceiptConfirmation or null
            deactivate DB

            Store->>+DB: SELECT Shipment linked to ReceiptConfirmation
            DB-->>Store: Shipment or null
            deactivate DB

            alt Receipt or Shipment is invalid

                Note right of Store: Return Conflict

            else Confirmed Receipt and Shipment exist

                %% ==========================================
                %% 4. VERIFY QR LABEL AND BATCH
                %% ==========================================

                Store->>+DB: SELECT BatchQrLabel JOIN Batch by LabelCode and Product
                DB-->>Store: QR Label and Batch or null
                deactivate DB

                alt QR Label is not valid for the SKU

                    Note right of Store: Return Not Found

                else QR Label matches the SKU

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 5. VERIFY RECEIPT ITEM
                    %% ==========================================

                    Store->>+DB: SELECT ReceiptConfirmationItem by ReceiptId and LabelId
                    DB-->>Store: Receipt item or null
                    deactivate DB

                    Note right of Store: Check ActualQuantity and optional ShipmentId

                    alt Receipt item or quantity is invalid

                        Note right of Store: Return Validation error or Conflict

                    else Receipt item is valid

                        %% ==========================================
                        %% 6. RETRIEVE FINAL BATCH PRICE
                        %% ==========================================

                        Store->>+DB: SELECT PickingItem JOIN Allocation for received Batch
                        DB-->>Store: AllocationId, NetAmount and AllocatedQuantity
                        deactivate DB

                        alt Allocation price is missing or mismatched

                            Note right of Store: Return Conflict or Validation error

                        else Allocation price is valid

                            %% ==========================================
                            %% 7. CALCULATE COMPLAINT AMOUNT
                            %% ==========================================

                            Note right of Store: FinalUnitPrice = NetAmount / AllocatedQuantity

                            Note right of Store: Calculate AdjustmentAmount from quantity difference

                            %% ==========================================
                            %% 8. CHECK DUPLICATE OPEN COMPLAINT
                            %% ==========================================

                            Store->>+DB: SELECT matching unresolved ReceiptDiscrepancy
                            DB-->>Store: Duplicate exists or not
                            deactivate DB

                            alt Matching complaint already exists

                                Note right of Store: Return Conflict

                            else No matching complaint exists

                                %% ==========================================
                                %% 9. CREATE COMPLAINT
                                %% ==========================================

                                Note right of Store: Set ReceiptDiscrepancy Status = Open

                                Note right of Store: Record SalesOrderId, ReceiptId and actor

                                %% ==========================================
                                %% 10. SAVE COMPLAINT AND ITEM
                                %% ==========================================

                                Store->>+DB: INSERT ReceiptDiscrepancy and ReceiptDiscrepancyItem

                                Note right of DB: Store ShipmentId, BatchId and AllocationId

                                Note right of DB: Store FinalUnitPrice and AdjustmentAmount

                                Note right of DB: Store optional EvidenceBlobUrl

                                DB-->>Store: Complaint records persisted
                                deactivate DB

                            end

                        end

                    end

                end

            end

        end

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 11. RETURN COMPLAINT CREATION
    %% ==========================================

    Store-->>Service: ReceiptDiscrepancy or business error
    deactivate Store

    Service-->>API: Created complaint or error
    deactivate Service

    %% ==========================================
    %% 12. BUILD COMPLAINT RESPONSE
    %% ==========================================

    opt Complaint was created successfully

        API->>+Service: ListAsync(actorId, Retailer, ct)

        Service->>+Store: ListAsync(actorId, Retailer, ct)

        Store->>+DB: SELECT complaints and related order, batch and product data

        Note right of DB: Filter results to the authenticated Retailer

        DB-->>Store: Scoped complaint records
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: ComplaintResult collection
        deactivate Store

        Service-->>API: ComplaintResult collection
        deactivate Service

        Note right of API: Select newly created ComplaintResult

    end

    API-->>Mobile: 201 Created with ComplaintResult or error
    deactivate API

    Mobile-->>Retailer: Display complaint submission result
    deactivate Mobile

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 2 - REVIEW COMPLAINTS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Reviewer,DB: PART 2 - REVIEW SHIPMENT-LINKED COMPLAINTS

    Reviewer->>+Portal: Open Complaint Management

    Portal->>+API: List()

    Note right of API: Endpoint permits Admin and Operator

    API->>+Service: ListAsync(actorId, role, ct)

    Service->>+Store: ListAsync(actorId, role, ct)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 13. LOAD COMPLAINT DATA
    %% ==========================================

    Store->>+DB: SELECT complaints JOIN orders, retailers and complaint items

    Note right of DB: Include Batch, Product and QR Label information

    DB-->>Store: Complaint review records
    deactivate DB

    Store-->>Service: ComplaintResult collection
    deactivate Store

    Service-->>API: ComplaintResult collection
    deactivate Service

    API-->>Portal: Complaint list
    deactivate API

    Portal-->>Reviewer: Display complaint details and evidence references
    deactivate Portal

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 3 - RESOLVE COMPLAINT
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Reviewer,DB: PART 3 - RECORD COMPLAINT REVIEW DECISION

    Reviewer->>+Portal: Submit complaint resolution

    Note right of Portal: Provide ComplaintId, Result and Approved flag

    Portal->>+API: Resolve(complaintId, request)

    Note right of API: Endpoint permits Admin and Operator

    API->>+Service: ResolveAsync(complaintId, actorId, data, ct)

    Service->>+Store: ResolveAsync(complaintId, actorId, data, now, ct)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 14. VALIDATE REVIEW RESULT
    %% ==========================================

    alt Resolution Result is missing

        Note right of Store: Return Validation error

    else Resolution Result is valid

        %% ==========================================
        %% 15. LOAD COMPLAINT FOR REVIEW
        %% ==========================================

        Store->>+DB: SELECT complaint JOIN order, retailer, item, batch and product
        DB-->>Store: Complaint review context or null
        deactivate DB

        alt Complaint does not exist

            Note right of Store: Return Not Found

        else Complaint already Approved, Rejected or Resolved

            Note right of Store: Return existing decision without another update

        else Complaint is open for review

            %% ==========================================
            %% 16. APPLY REVIEW DECISION
            %% ==========================================

            alt Reviewer approves complaint

                Note right of Store: Set Status = Approved

            else Reviewer rejects complaint

                Note right of Store: Set Status = Rejected

            end

            Note right of Store: Set ReviewedByUserId and ReviewedAt

            Note right of Store: Set ResolvedAt and decision Note

            %% ==========================================
            %% 17. SAVE REVIEW DECISION
            %% ==========================================

            Store->>+DB: UPDATE ReceiptDiscrepancy review fields

            DB-->>Store: Resolution saved
            deactivate DB

        end

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 18. RETURN RESOLUTION RESULT
    %% ==========================================

    Store-->>Service: ComplaintResult or business error
    deactivate Store

    %% ==========================================
    %% 19. REEVALUATE ORDER COMPLETION
    %% ==========================================

    opt Complaint resolution returned successfully

        Service->>+Completion: EvaluateAsync(salesOrderId, actorId, ct)

        Completion->>+CompletionStore: FindAsync(salesOrderId, ct)

        CompletionStore->>+DB: SELECT SalesOrder, Payment and open complaint existence

        Note right of DB: Open complaint means ResolvedAt is null

        DB-->>CompletionStore: OrderCompletionView or null
        deactivate DB

        CompletionStore-->>Completion: Order completion conditions
        deactivate CompletionStore

        %% ==========================================
        %% 20. CHECK ORDER COMPLETION GATE
        %% ==========================================

        alt Order missing or already Completed

            Note right of Completion: Return current completion result

        else Order is not Delivered or Payment is not settled

            Note right of Completion: Keep order not Completed

            Completion->>+Loyalty: EvaluateAsync(salesOrderId, actorId, ct)

            Loyalty-->>Completion: Loyalty evaluation result
            deactivate Loyalty

        else Another complaint remains open

            Note right of Completion: Hold order completion

            Completion->>+Loyalty: EvaluateAsync(salesOrderId, actorId, ct)

            Loyalty-->>Completion: Loyalty evaluation result
            deactivate Loyalty

        else All completion conditions are satisfied

            %% ==========================================
            %% 21. COMPLETE SALES ORDER
            %% ==========================================

            Completion->>+CompletionStore: CompleteAsync(salesOrderId, actorId, now, ct)

            CompletionStore->>+DB: UPDATE SalesOrder to Completed

            Note right of DB: INSERT OrderStatusHistory

            DB-->>CompletionStore: Completion persisted
            deactivate DB

            CompletionStore-->>Completion: Completion saved
            deactivate CompletionStore

            %% ==========================================
            %% 22. EVALUATE LOYALTY
            %% ==========================================

            Completion->>+Loyalty: EvaluateAsync(salesOrderId, actorId, ct)

            Loyalty-->>Completion: Loyalty evaluation result
            deactivate Loyalty

        end

        %% ==========================================
        %% 23. RETURN COMPLETION EVALUATION
        %% ==========================================

        Completion-->>Service: OrderCompletionResult
        deactivate Completion

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 24. RETURN REVIEW RESPONSE
    %% ==========================================

    Service-->>API: ComplaintResult or business error
    deactivate Service

    API-->>Portal: Resolution response
    deactivate API

    Portal-->>Reviewer: Display complaint resolution result
    deactivate Portal

    %% ==========================================
    %% BUSINESS CONSTRAINTS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Store,DB: A complaint must reference the actual received Shipment and Batch

    Note over Store,DB: FinalUnitPrice is derived from the existing Allocation

    Note over Store,DB: Resolving a complaint does not automatically adjust Payment

    Note over Store,DB: Resolving a complaint does not automatically create ManualRefund

    Note over Completion,DB: Order completion requires Delivered, Paid and no open complaint